{"id": "q0101", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3720081385, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Riproarin' Ringo was roping a recalcitrant dogie. Ringo decided to give the dogie a reprieve by calculating \\[|(1-i)^8|\\]before riding after the dogie. What answer should Ringo have found?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0101.wav", "input_sha256": "1ec9e7f5f9ada392c830d2d5b2f748a327a5dac43cbc6c5604f062faa0a5104d", "input_samples": 222000, "input_s": 13.875, "n_real_chunks": 14, "score": 0.4008, "act": 0.9976, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "1 i 8 means one times i to the eighth power. I is the square root of negative one, so let's see what happens when we raise it to different powers. If we start with i and multiply by itself, we get negative one. Then if we take that negative one and multi ply by i again, we get positive one. And then if we do it once more, we get back to i. So this pattern repeat s every four power s. That means i to the fourth power is one. Since eight is a multiple of four, i to the eighth power is just one times one, which is one. So Ringo should have found one.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 37, "feed_lag_max_ms": 89, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 89, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0101_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "d53d7bcedc193eadb482c5ac4a820e5afb2ec137e4abb0d2f5540940abee1881", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 35.92}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.076, 1.136, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.08, 2.145, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.088, 3.156, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.079, 4.144, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.087, 5.156, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.086, 6.156, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.087, 7.158, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.084, 8.151, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.09, 9.164, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.088, 10.16, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.09, 11.16, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.092, 12.166, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.09, 13.162, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 13.875, 13.964, 14.037, 1, 0, 0], [14, 0, 14.875, 14.964, 15.175, 0, 0, 0], [15, 0, 15.875, 15.961, 16.681, 0, 24000, 0], [16, 0, 16.875, 16.959, 17.671, 0, 24000, 0], [17, 0, 17.875, 17.969, 18.83, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.875, 18.968, 19.687, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.875, 19.972, 20.79, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.875, 20.969, 21.775, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.875, 21.973, 22.818, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.875, 22.985, 23.698, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.875, 23.961, 24.779, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.875, 24.964, 25.753, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.875, 25.97, 26.749, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.875, 26.97, 27.771, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.875, 27.97, 28.868, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.875, 28.966, 29.734, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.875, 29.966, 30.821, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.875, 30.966, 31.724, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.875, 31.969, 32.872, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.875, 32.963, 33.68, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.875, 33.959, 34.657, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.875, 34.964, 35.826, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.875, 35.967, 36.834, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.875, 36.967, 37.729, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.875, 37.968, 38.719, 0, 24000, 0], [38, 0, 38.875, 38.96, 39.72, 0, 24000, 0], [39, 0, 39.875, 39.965, 40.749, 0, 24000, 0], [40, 0, 40.875, 40.966, 41.807, 0, 24000, 0], [41, 0, 41.875, 41.963, 42.722, 0, 24000, 0], [42, 0, 42.875, 42.967, 43.67, 0, 24000, 0], [43, 0, 43.875, 43.967, 44.798, 0, 24000, 0], [44, 0, 44.875, 44.971, 45.766, 0, 24000, 0], [45, 0, 45.875, 45.968, 46.712, 0, 24000, 0], [46, 0, 46.875, 46.971, 47.816, 0, 24000, 0], [47, 0, 47.875, 47.971, 48.764, 0, 24000, 0], [48, 0, 48.875, 48.968, 49.964, 0, 24000, 0], [49, 0, 49.875, 50.053, 50.785, 0, 24000, 0], [50, 0, 50.875, 50.969, 51.539, 0, 22080, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 13.875, "last_real_feed_done": 13.964, "onset": 15.175, "gate_read_done": 15.175, "fire": null, "candidate_first_pcm": null, "stall_note": null, "stall_first_pcm": null, "local_first_pcm": 16.681, "wait_start": null, "expert_req": null, "expert_resp": null, "relay_synth_start": null, "relay_first_pcm": null, "relay_synth_end": null, "first_any_pcm": 16.681, "first_answer_pcm": 16.681, "session_end": 51.539}, "ttfa_answer_s": 2.806, "ttfa_any_s": 2.806}
{"id": "q0117", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 767785885, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "Let $z = 2 + \\sqrt{2} - (3 + 3 \\sqrt{2})i$, and let $c = 2 - 3i$.  Let $w$ be the result when $z$ is rotated around $c$ by $\\frac{\\pi}{4}$ counter-clockwise.\n\n[asy]\nunitsize(0.6 cm);\n\npair C, W, Z;\n\nZ = (2 + sqrt(2), -3 - 3*sqrt(2));\nC = (2,-3);\nW = rotate(45,C)*(Z);\n\ndraw(Z--C--W);\n\ndot(\"$c$\", C, N);\ndot(\"$w$\", W, SE);\ndot(\"$z$\", Z, S);\nlabel(\"$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$\", C + (0.6,-1));\n[/asy]\n\nFind $w.$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0117.wav", "input_sha256": "a4ec9baee8bdbfc79d9150b0c10f81b383e91953897fdfc2f63c8d540224ffc9", "input_samples": 451600, "input_s": 28.225, "n_real_chunks": 29, "score": 0.7722, "act": 0.9969, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "To rotate a complex number z around another complex number c by an angle theta, we can use the formula w equals c plus e to the i theta times z minus c. So in this case, z is 2 plus square root 2 minus 3 plus 3 square root 2 i, c is 2 minus 3i, and the angle is pi over 4. Let's calculate z minus c first. That would be 2 plus square root 2 minus 3 plus 3 square root 2 i minus 2 plus 3i, which simpl ifies to square root 2 plus 3 square root 2 i plus 3 i. Next, we need to find e to the i times pi over 4, which is the same as co s pi over 4 plus i sine pi over 4, which is root 2 over 2 plus i root 2 over 2. Now, multiply that by z minus c. Let me do that step by step. Multi plying root 2 over 2 times square root 2 gives 1, and multi plying root 2 over 2 times 3 square root 2 i gives", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 28, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 290, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 765, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0117_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "439e8f2f3a47b1a5a0c70abc64248ff15505a76556297981c9c95ab4e6147896", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.084, 1.152, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.084, 2.151, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.087, 3.156, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.088, 4.16, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.085, 5.152, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.085, 6.158, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.086, 7.156, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.09, 8.162, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.089, 9.16, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.087, 10.154, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.085, 11.152, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.086, 12.154, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.094, 13.169, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.085, 14.151, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.086, 15.152, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.089, 16.154, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.091, 17.157, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.09, 18.16, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.085, 19.151, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.098, 20.174, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.09, 21.16, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.092, 22.162, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.093, 23.164, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.097, 24.169, 1, 0, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.098, 25.174, 1, 0, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.095, 26.166, 1, 0, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.097, 27.17, 1, 0, 0], [27, 1, 28.0, 28.096, 28.169, 1, 0, 0], [28, 1, 28.225, 28.319, 29.125, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.225, 29.315, 30.071, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.225, 30.319, 31.091, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.225, 31.319, 32.147, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.225, 32.315, 33.095, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.225, 33.317, 34.04, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.225, 34.319, 35.009, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.225, 35.316, 36.066, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0,