{"id": "q0196", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2451423491, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "A group of students were invited to taste phenylthiocarbamide (PTC). The ability to taste PTC is inherited by a single pair of genes and tasting (T) is dominant to non-tasting (t). Among 798 students, 60.4 percent were tasters, a) Calculate the allelic frequency of T and t. b) How many of the students were TT? Tt? tt?\n\nA. Frequency of T is .371, Frequency of t is .629, Number of students with TT is 109, Tt is 373, tt is 316\nB. Frequency of T is .396, Frequency of t is .604, Number of students with TT is 150, Tt is 348, tt is 300\nC. Frequency of T is .533, Frequency of t is .467, Number of students with TT is 200, Tt is 398, tt is 200\nD. Frequency of T is .440, Frequency of t is .560, Number of students with TT is 220, Tt is 358, tt is 220\nE. Frequency of T is .629, Frequency of t is .371, Number of students with TT is 180, Tt is 418, tt is 200\nF. Frequency of T is .604, Frequency of t is .396, Number of students with TT is 373, Tt is 316, tt is 109\nG. Frequency of T is .467, Frequency of t is .533, Number of students with TT is 250, Tt is 298, tt is 250\nH. Frequency of T is .560, Frequency of t is .440, Number of students with TT is 180, Tt is 438, tt is 180\nI. Frequency of T is .467, Frequency of t is .533, Number of students with TT is 109, Tt is 373, tt is 316\nJ. Frequency of T is .629, Frequency of t is .371, Number of students with TT is 316, Tt is 373, tt is 109\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0196.wav", "input_sha256": "898c4ae0c98b7f0e9f7c5268e7ccb4d18acf314e2faff6336809c6ad069908d9", "input_samples": 1864800, "input_s": 116.55, "n_real_chunks": 117, "score": 0.9024, "act": 0.996, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "A. Frequency of T is 0.371; frequency of t is 0.629. Correct genotype counts are approximately: tt = 316 students , Tt = 373 students , TT = 109 students", "expert_answer": "**A. Frequency of T is 0.371; frequency of t is 0.629.**\n\nCorrect genotype counts are approximately:\n\n- **tt = 316 students**\n- **Tt = 373 students**\n- **TT = 109 students**", "transcript": "A group of students were invited to taste phenylthiocarbamide, PTC. The ability to taste PTC is inherited by a single pair of genes, and tasting T is dominant to non-tasting t. Among 798 students, 60.4% were tasters. A. Calculate the allelic frequency of T and t. B. How many of the students were tt?", "asr_s": 7.47, "expert_s": 8.55, "expert_input_samples": 1864800, "expert_input_s": 116.55, "expert_input_sha256": "898c4ae0c98b7f0e9f7c5268e7ccb4d18acf314e2faff6336809c6ad069908d9", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 11.615, "relay_synth_ms": 12282, "onset_chunk": 116, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 3364, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 3364, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0196_balanced_relay.wav", "sha256": "6a45644f8ff75eabcaa3de2f6ffe75f0c1b5f6dda83ba3c4f19f1d3d84a7da18", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 20.36}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0196_balanced_candidate.wav", "sha256": "f054f9c767784944cff1c07653e1139253e19b57c678abdb0d09ec33d29bb740", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0196_balanced_stall.wav", "sha256": "e9cbadbf2d772a266e20c06801de5d7502086462656dae3f9ff14b47d42b4159", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.52}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.079, 1.142, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.081, 2.146, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.082, 3.146, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.082, 4.15, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1