{"id": "q0287", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4266098317, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "A sofa has a markup of 20% based on its selling price. Find the percent markup based on the cost.\n\nA. 28%\nB. 15%\nC. 22%\nD. 10%\nE. 30%\nF. 20%\nG. 40%\nH. 18%\nI. 25%\nJ. 35%\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0287.wav", "input_sha256": "7a3d3df789a585608e37c59fddf786d50fae79a2d747736b54bb1b0162dd4c11", "input_samples": 276600, "input_s": 17.288, "n_real_chunks": 18, "score": 0.5505, "act": 0.9957, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So let's say the selling price is S and the cost is C. The markup is 20% of S, so that means the cost plus 2 0% of S equals S. That gives us C = 0.8 S, or S = 1. 25 C. Now, to find the percent mark up based on cost, we calculate the difference between the selling price and the cost relative to the cost. That' s S minus C over C times 10 0%. Substit uting S as 1.2 5C, we get 0. 25C over C times 10 0%, which is 2 5%. Wait, that' s not one of the options. Let me double check. Oh, I see. If the markup is 2 0% of the selling price, then the cost is 8 0% of the selling price. So if the selling price is $100, the cost would be $ 80. The mark up is $2 0. So the percent mark up based on cost is 20 divided by 80 times 100, which is 2 5%. Still not matching any option. Hmm, maybe I misread the question. It says \"markup of 20% based on its selling price.\" That", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 17, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 64, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 256, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0287_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "00ef64dbd704f9d77c7aff2767380d27a23274eb37f9d4abd52e8b7821d59c73", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.076, 1.139, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.078, 2.14, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.079, 3.143, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.079, 4.143, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.08, 5.147, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.081, 6.148, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.082, 7.148, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.082, 8.149, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.081, 9.146, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.081, 10.145, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.085, 11.154, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.082, 12.147, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.079, 13.143, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.083, 14.149, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.085, 15.149, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.082, 16.146, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.082, 17.147, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 17.288, 17.377, 18.305, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.288, 18.391, 19.333, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.288, 19.42, 20.071, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.288, 20.372, 21.274, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.288, 21.371, 22.132, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.288, 22.373, 23.046, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.288, 23.375, 24.262, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.288, 24.374, 25.201, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.288, 25.375, 26.125, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.288, 26.375, 27.163, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.288, 27.38, 28.147, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.288, 28.376, 29.126, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.288, 29.375, 30.198, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.288, 30.378, 31.175, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.288, 31.373, 32.173, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.288, 32.378, 33.175, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.288, 33.375, 34.137, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.288, 34.371, 35.113, 0, 24000, 0], [35, 0, 35.288, 35.379, 36.152, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.288, 36.373, 37.05, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.288, 37.374, 38.164, 0, 24000, 0], [