{"id": "q0459", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2833011061, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "What are some basic spirits you should have at your bar", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0459.wav", "input_sha256": "b29397119c0a30b55bf41a0cf43e057efabfde6654c1c5de5231e6048ba54b24", "input_samples": 52400, "input_s": 3.275, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.7107, "act": 0.9994, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Well, I mean, the basics are really just the basic spirits. You need some rum, you need some tequila or me zcal, and then you need some gin, some vodka, and then you need some whiskey. And then from there, you can start to build your bar with other ingredients like liqueurs and things like that. But those are kind of the basics.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 17, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0459_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "0404faa48dfd31255661ffdcb7e38d23e7a008ce5a1be3f04bd8c278a0518e1b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 16.36}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.085, 1.153, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.087, 2.156, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.083, 3.15, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.275, 3.36, 3.757, 0, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.275, 4.357, 5.195, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.275, 5.36, 6.128, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.275, 6.366, 7.207, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.275, 7.36, 8.074, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.275, 8.