{"id": "q0526", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1994436628, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "0c0eb5f5089b4570f4b5f593318ef7c0c5f8ba06a58bdaf93a6686b9afa1d86e", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 4, "query": "提出在交通领域减少碳排放的解决方案。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0526.wav", "input_sha256": "ec15ad0632b764a9823d82f868dd7ebda73b58052ec2a5081db02723a627a205", "input_samples": 63200, "input_s": 3.95, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.1965, "act": 0.9988, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "在交通领域减少碳排放，一个有效的办法是推广公共交通。比如多发展地铁、公交和轻轨等绿色交通工具，能让更多人选择不开车出行。另外，鼓励大家骑自行车或步行也很重要，这样既环保又健康。还可以推广电动汽车，政府可以提供补贴来降低购买成本。同时，优化城市规划，让住宅区、商业区和工业区更接近，也能减少通勤距离。总之，多管齐下才能真正降低交通带来的碳排放。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 38, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0526_balanced_local.wav", "sha256": "8949df2031133a1dc81277fd9f20db3ae180e9f193d0d19612db4fd013a9a498", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 38.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.082, 1.153, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.085, 2.152, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.087, 3.156, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.95, 4.037, 4.108, 1, 0, 0], [4, 0, 4.95, 5.033, 5.787, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.95, 6.038, 6.852, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.95, 7.037, 7.839, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.95, 8.034, 8.785, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.95, 9.036, 9.798, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.95, 10.038, 10.764, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.95, 11.037, 11.836, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.95, 12.04, 12.842, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.95, 13.04, 13.794, 0, 24000, 0